---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="About Enyinnaya Omeruah | Virtual Concept Technologies"
  description="Learn about Enyinnaya Omeruah, a Technology & Cybersecurity Specialist with experience across cybersecurity, AI, networking, technical education, and digital technology."
>
  <main>

    <!-- INTRODUCTION -->
    <section class="bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-32">

        <div class="max-w-4xl">

          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            VCT / About
          </p>

          <h1 class="mt-6 text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-6xl">
            Enyinnaya Omeruah
          </h1>

          <p class="mt-5 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-700">
            Technology & Cybersecurity Specialist
          </p>

          <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            Enyinnaya Omeruah is a cybersecurity and technology professional
            with experience spanning network engineering, cybersecurity,
            artificial intelligence, technical education, and digital
            technology.
          </p>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            At Virtual Concept Technologies, he applies his experience in
            technology, cybersecurity, networking, AI, and technical education
            to the development of practical, secure, and accessible digital
            solutions.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <a
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/enyinnaya-omeruah"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex rounded-lg bg-slate-950 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-slate-800"
            >
              View LinkedIn Profile
            </a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- AREAS OF EXPERIENCE -->
    <section class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-slate-50">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            Professional Focus
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
            Technology grounded in practical experience.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
            His professional experience brings together several areas that
            directly support the work of Virtual Concept Technologies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">01</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Cybersecurity
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              Cybersecurity awareness, security fundamentals, vulnerability
              assessment, network security, and practical security education.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">02</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Networking
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              Network infrastructure, routing, firewalls, VPNs, DNS, DHCP,
              troubleshooting, and secure network operations.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">03</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              AI & Technology
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              Practical applications of AI, digital solutions, automation,
              emerging technologies, and technology-driven problem solving.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold text-blue-600">04</p>
            <h3 class="mt-6 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Technical Education
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">
              Hands-on instruction, technical mentoring, practical labs, and
              training in networking, Linux, cybersecurity, and related IT
              skills.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- PROFESSIONAL JOURNEY -->
    <section class="bg-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-3xl">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-600">
            Professional Journey
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-950 sm:text-4xl">
            Experience across technology and education.
          </h2>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 max-w-4xl space-y-6">

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-7 sm:p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              2026 – Present
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Africa Cybersecurity and AI Project Manager
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
              International Association of Cybersecurity & AI Professionals
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Working across cybersecurity and AI initiatives with a focus on
              technology projects and digital transformation in Africa.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-7 sm:p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              2026 – Present
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Cybersecurity Analyst | Instructor
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
              Virtual Concept Technologies
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Providing cybersecurity education, practical technical guidance,
              virtual lab support, and mentoring in networking, Linux systems,
              and cybersecurity fundamentals.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-7 sm:p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              2025 – 2026
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Cybersecurity Instructor
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
              Bizmarrow Technologies ICT and Computer Training School
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Designed and delivered practical cybersecurity training,
              including networking, Linux systems, vulnerability assessment,
              and certification preparation.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-7 sm:p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              2022 – 2024
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              ICT Trainer & Instructor
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
              International Technical School of Kigali
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Delivered practical instruction in networking, cybersecurity,
              Linux administration, and cloud fundamentals, training more than
              200 students and professionals.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-7 sm:p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              2021 – 2024
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Network Engineer
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
              Swapxpert
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Configured and maintained network infrastructure including
              routers, firewalls, VPN connectivity, DHCP, DNS, NAT, and secure
              network access solutions.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-7 sm:p-8">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-blue-600">
              Earlier Experience
            </p>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-950">
              Network Administration, ICT Training & Technical Support
            </h3>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">
              Professional experience across Nigeria
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-600">
              Earlier roles included network administration, ICT instruction,
              computer networking, troubleshooting, software support, and
              hands-on technical assistance.
            </p>
          </article>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>


    <!-- VCT CONNECTION -->
    <section class="bg-slate-950 text-white">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">

        <div class="max-w-3xl">

          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-blue-400">
            Virtual Concept Technologies
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
            Building practical technology for real-world needs.
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">
            VCT brings together AI, cybersecurity, digital technology, and
            technical education to help individuals and organizations build,
            secure, and enable their digital capabilities.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">

            <a
              href="/contact/"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-blue-600 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-blue-700"
            >
              Start a Project
            </a>

            <a
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/enyinnaya-omeruah"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-slate-700 px-6 py-3.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-slate-500"
            >
              Connect on LinkedIn
            </a>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
</MainLayout>
